 },
 "duration": 282.059,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "h01",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "This is Frank.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 1.478,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h02",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "Frank just died at eighty-five, with more than two million dollars in the bank.",
   "refs": [
    "frank.end_age",
    "=2000000"
   ],
   "start": 1.898,
   "end": 6.342,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h03",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "On his desk is a travel brochure for Italy.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 6.762,
   "end": 9.603,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h04",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "He picked it up when he was thirty-two.",
   "refs": [
    "=32"
   ],
   "start": 10.023,
   "end": 12.064,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h05",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "He never went.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 12.484,
   "end": 13.612,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h06",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "Frank did everything right with money.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 14.032,
   "end": 16.209,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h07",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "So why does this story feel so wrong?",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 16.629,
   "end": 18.905,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h08",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "Today: three friends, one income, and three very different lives.",
   "refs": [
    "=3",
    "=1",
    "=3"
   ],
   "start": 19.325,
   "end": 22.926,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "h09",
   "section": "hook",
   "text": "Only one of them gets it right.",
   "refs": [
    "=1"
   ],
   "start": 23.346,
   "end": 25.249,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m01",
   "section": "meet",
   "text": "Meet Frank, Yara and Bea.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 26.049,
   "end": 27.772,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m02",
   "section": "meet",
   "text": "They're twenty-five, they all earn sixty thousand dollars a year, and they all start work in the same month.",
   "refs": [
    "frank.start_age",
    "frank.gross_salary"
   ],
   "start": 28.192,
   "end": 34.231,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m03",
   "section": "meet",
   "text": "Same job, same money.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 34.651,
   "end": 36.274,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m04",
   "section": "meet",
   "text": "The only difference is what they do with it.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 36.694,
   "end": 38.986,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "m05",
   "section": "meet",
   "text": "Quick note: these people are made up, and the numbers are examples, not advice.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 39.406,
   "end": 43.832,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "f01",
   "section": "frank",
   "text": "Let's start with Frank.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 44.632,
   "end": 46.011,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "f02",
   "section": "frank",
   "text": "Frank is a saving machine.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 46.431,
   "end": 48.146,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "f03",
   "section": "frank",
   "text": "He builds an emergency fund in his first year.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 48.566,
   "end": 51.265,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "f04",
   "section": "frank",
   "text": "He never carries credit card debt.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 51.685,
   "end": 53.735,
   "chunk": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "f05",
   "section": "frank",
   "text": "He invests every month, automatically.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 54.155,
   "end": 56.398,
   "chunk": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "f06",
   "section": "frank",
   "text": "Honestly? That's great.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 56.818,
   "end": 58.219,
   "chunk": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "f07",
   "section": "frank",
   "text": "Do those three things and you're already off to a strong start.",
   "refs": [
    "=3"
   ],
   "start": 58.639,
   "end": 61.713,
   "chunk": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "f08",
   "section": "frank",
   "text": "But Frank doesn't stop there.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 62.133,
   "end": 63.798,
   "chunk": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "f09",
   "section": "frank",
   "text": "Frank saves half of everything he takes home.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 64.218,
   "end": 66.856,
   "chunk": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "f10",
   "section": "frank",
   "text": "He eats the cheapest meals, skips every wedding abroad, and when his friends plan a trip, he says the same thing every time: 'Maybe next year.'",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 67.276,
   "end": 75.333,
   "chunk": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "y01",
   "section": "nextyear",
   "text": "At thirty-two, Frank picks up that brochure for Italy.",
   "refs": [
    "=32"
   ],
   "start": 76.133,
   "end": 79.144,
   "chunk": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "y02",
   "section": "nextyear",
   "text": "Next year.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 79.564,
   "end": 80.482,
   "chunk": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "y03",
   "section": "nextyear",
   "text": "At forty, his daughter asks him to come to a concert.",
   "refs": [
    "=40"
   ],
   "start": 80.902,
   "end": 84.03,
   "chunk": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "y04",
   "section": "nextyear",
   "text": "Too expensive. Next year.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 84.45,
   "end": 86.137,
   "chunk": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "y05",
   "section": "nextyear",
   "text": "At fifty, his knees start to complain, and the hiking trip he always wanted feels harder.",
   "refs": [
    "=50"
   ],
   "start": 86.557,
   "end": 92.052,
   "chunk": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "y06",
   "section": "nextyear",
   "text": "Next year.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 92.472,
   "end": 93.39,
   "chunk": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "y07",
   "section": "nextyear",
   "text": "Here's what Frank never saw.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 93.81,
   "end": 95.502,
   "chunk": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "y08",
   "section": "nextyear",
   "text": "Look at this chart.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 95.922,
   "end": 97.156,
   "chunk": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "y09",
   "section": "nextyear",
   "text": "This line is Frank's money. It goes up and up.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 97.576,
   "end": 100.261,
   "chunk": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "y10",
   "section": "nextyear",
   "text": "But this line is his health and energy, and it slowly comes down.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 100.681,
   "end": 104.589,
   "chunk": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "y11",
   "section": "nextyear",
   "text": "Some experiences have an expiry date.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 105.009,
   "end": 107.426,
   "chunk": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "y12",
   "section": "nextyear",
   "text": "You can't take your kids to the park when they're thirty.",
   "refs": [
    "=30"
   ],
   "start": 107.846,
   "end": 110.582,
   "chunk": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "y13",
   "section": "nextyear",
   "text": "You can't backpack across Italy at seventy-five the way you could at thirty-five.",
   "refs": [
    "=75",
    "=35"
   ],
   "start": 111.002,
   "end": 115.648,
   "chunk": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "y14",
   "section": "nextyear",
   "text": "Waiting doesn't just cost money. It costs moments.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 116.068,
   "end": 119.129,
   "chunk": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "r01",
   "section": "retire",
   "text": "Frank retires at sixty-five as a multi-millionaire.",
   "refs": [
    "frank.retire_age"
   ],
   "start": 119.929,
   "end": 123.199,
   "chunk": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "r02",
   "section": "retire",
   "text": "And then he keeps living like he's broke, because forty years of habit is hard to switch off.",
   "refs": [
    "=40"
   ],
   "start": 123.619,
   "end": 128.672,
   "chunk": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "r03",
   "section": "retire",
   "text": "Research on retirees suggests this is surprisingly common: many people with large savings spend very little of them, even nearly two decades into retirement.",
   "refs": [
    "=2"
   ],
   "start": 129.092,
   "end": 139.452,
   "chunk": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "r04",
   "section": "retire",
   "text": "Frank was never poor. He just never let himself be rich.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 139.872,
   "end": 143.258,
   "chunk": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "r05",
   "section": "retire",
   "text": "And hold that thought, because the person who gets this right doesn't save the most, or spend the most.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 143.678,
   "end": 149.18,
   "chunk": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "a01",
   "section": "yara",
   "text": "So the answer is to spend it all, right?",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 149.98,
   "end": 152.168,
   "chunk": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "a02",
   "section": "yara",
   "text": "Meet Yara.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 152.588,
   "end": 153.623,
   "chunk": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "a03",
   "section": "yara",
   "text": "Yara's motto is 'you only live once.'",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 154.043,
   "end": 156.279,
   "chunk": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "a04",
   "section": "yara",
   "text": "A new car at twenty-six.",
   "refs": [
    "=26"
   ],
   "start": 156.699,
   "end": 158.364,
   "chunk": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "a05",
   "section": "yara",
   "text": "Holidays on credit cards.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 158.784,
   "end": 160.624,
   "chunk": 2
  },
  {
   "id": "a06",
   "section": "yara",
   "text": "A bigger apartment every time she gets a raise.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 161.044,
   "end": 164.061,
   "chunk": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "a07",
   "section": "yara",
   "text": "Her thirties look amazing online.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 164.481,
   "end": 166.608,
   "chunk": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "a08",
   "section": "yara",
   "text": "But Yara never builds a safety net.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 167.028,
   "end": 169.376,
   "chunk": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "a09",
   "section": "yara",
   "text": "When she loses her job at forty-four, the card balances pile up fast.",
   "refs": [
    "yara.job_loss_age"
   ],
   "start": 169.796,
   "end": 174.099,
   "chunk": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "a10",
   "section": "yara",
   "text": "At sixty-seven, Yara is still working.",
   "refs": [
    "yara.still_working_age"
   ],
   "start": 174.519,
   "end": 176.908,
   "chunk": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "a11",
   "section": "yara",
   "text": "Not because she wants to, but because she has to.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 177.328,
   "end": 179.917,
   "chunk": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "a12",
   "section": "yara",
   "text": "Frank forgot to live. Yara forgot that she'd keep living.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 180.337,
   "end": 183.771,
   "chunk": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "b01",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "And then there's Bea.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 184.571,
   "end": 185.788,
   "chunk": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "b02",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "Bea earns exactly the same as the other two.",
   "refs": [
    "=2"
   ],
   "start": 186.208,
   "end": 188.786,
   "chunk": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "b03",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "But Bea has a system.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 189.206,
   "end": 190.708,
   "chunk": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "b04",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "Step one: foundations first.",
   "refs": [
    "=1"
   ],
   "start": 191.128,
   "end": 193.025,
   "chunk": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "b05",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "Before anything fun, Bea builds an emergency fund, clears high-interest debt, and sets up automatic retirement saving.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 193.445,
   "end": 200.969,
   "chunk": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "b06",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "Those don't move.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 201.389,
   "end": 202.717,
   "chunk": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "b07",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "Step two: she works out her 'enough' number, a rough target for what she'll need in retirement.",
   "refs": [
    "=2"
   ],
   "start": 203.137,
   "end": 208.083,
   "chunk": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "b08",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "Once she's on track, extra saving isn't a must. It's a choice.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 208.503,
   "end": 212.356,
   "chunk": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "b09",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "Step three: a guilt-free life fund.",
   "refs": [
    "=3"
   ],
   "start": 212.776,
   "end": 214.87,
   "chunk": 3
  },
  {
   "id": "b10",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "Every month, a set amount goes into a pot just for experiences.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 215.29,
   "end": 219.301,
   "chunk": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "b11",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "Concerts, trips, hobbies.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 219.721,
   "end": 221.337,
   "chunk": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "b12",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "When she spends it, she doesn't feel guilty, because she planned it.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 221.757,
   "end": 224.934,
   "chunk": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "b13",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "Step four: she plans by decade.",
   "refs": [
    "=4"
   ],
   "start": 225.354,
   "end": 227.423,
   "chunk": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "b14",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "Bea writes down what she wants to do in her thirties, forties and fifties, and funds the things that expire first.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 227.843,
   "end": 234.39,
   "chunk": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "b15",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "Backpacking at thirty-four.",
   "refs": [
    "=34"
   ],
   "start": 234.81,
   "end": 236.528,
   "chunk": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "b16",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "Theme parks while her kids still want to go with her.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 236.948,
   "end": 239.687,
   "chunk": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "b17",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "Step five: a yearly check-in.",
   "refs": [
    "=5"
   ],
   "start": 240.107,
   "end": 241.973,
   "chunk": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "b18",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "If she's ahead of plan, she spends some of the extra on purpose.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 242.393,
   "end": 245.816,
   "chunk": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "b19",
   "section": "bea",
   "text": "If she's behind, the life fund shrinks for a while.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 246.236,
   "end": 249.035,
   "chunk": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "e01",
   "section": "end",
   "text": "So how do they end up?",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 249.835,
   "end": 251.274,
   "chunk": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "e02",
   "section": "end",
   "text": "Frank has the most money and the fewest memories.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 251.694,
   "end": 254.44,
   "chunk": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "e03",
   "section": "end",
   "text": "Yara has the best thirties and the most stress later.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 254.86,
   "end": 257.618,
   "chunk": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "e04",
   "section": "end",
   "text": "Bea has less money than Frank, but enough.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 258.038,
   "end": 260.341,
   "chunk": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "e05",
   "section": "end",
   "text": "And she finally went to Italy.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 260.761,
   "end": 262.543,
   "chunk": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "e06",
   "section": "end",
   "text": "At thirty-four. And again at sixty.",
   "refs": [
    "=34",
    "=60"
   ],
   "start": 262.964,
   "end": 265.086,
   "chunk": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "c01",
   "section": "close",
   "text": "Money is a tool for buying a life.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 265.886,
   "end": 268.002,
   "chunk": 4
  },
  {
   "id": "c02",
   "section": "close",
   "text": "Don't spend it all at once. But don't forget to spend it at all.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 268.422,
   "end": 272.057,
   "chunk": 5
  },
  {
   "id": "c03",
   "section": "close",
   "text": "So here's a question: what's on your 'next year' list that won't wait forever?",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 272.477,
   "end": 276.606,
   "chunk": 5
  },
  {
   "id": "c04",
   "section": "close",
   "text": "Tell me in the comments.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 277.026,
   "end": 278.391,
   "chunk": 5
  },
  {
   "id": "c06",
   "section": "close",
   "text": "I'm Ren. See you next time.",
   "refs": [],
   "start": 278.811,
   "end": 280.459,
   "chunk": 5
  }
 ],
